{"sourceUrl":"https://math.ouc.edu.cn/2026/0915/c24849a537179/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:17.810834+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://math.ouc.edu.cn/2026/0915/c24849a537179/page.psp","html":"<div><div><p></p><p><br/></p><p><span>一、综合考核总体安排</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span><span>综合考核</span><span>采用现场考核方式。</span></span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span><span>综合考核</span><span>时间：</span></span></span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日</span><span>-19</span><span>日。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span><span>综合考核</span><span>地点：</span></span></span></p><p><span>中国海洋大学数学科学学院（青岛市松岭路</span><span>238</span><span>号，</span></p><p><span><span><span>崂山校区数学楼）。</span><span> </span><span></span></span></span></p><p><span>二、报到</span></p><p><span>时间：</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日</span><span>08:30-09:30</span></p><p><span>地点：数学楼</span><span>416</span><span>房间</span></p><p><span>所需材料：</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>有效居民身份证；</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>本科在读期间成绩单及本科成绩排名证明纸质版（均须加盖学校或学院教务主管部门公章）；</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>外语水平证明或外语资格考试成绩单；</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>各类获奖证书、已发表论文等其他证明材料；</span></p><p><span>5.</span><span><span><span>学信网《教育部学籍在线验证报告》（有效期内）</span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>6.</span></span><span><span><span><span>《</span></span><span>思想政治素质与品德考核</span><span><span>》</span></span><span><span>表（盖章）</span></span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span>三、综合考核时间安排</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>思想政治素质与品德考核</span></p><p><span>时间：</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日</span><span>10:00-12:00</span></p><p><span>等候室：数学楼</span><span>604</span><span>房间，</span><span>09:50</span><span>所有考生签到</span></p><p><span>地点：考核房间号、考核序号将在等候室公布。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>外国语听力与口语测试</span></p><p><span>时间：</span><span>2026</spa